  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Manafwa Capacity Building Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice, Beneficiaries: 471 Farmers; 370 male and 101 female, Summary: The project funds will be used to hire office staff; train staff in good governance practices; purchase accounting software and train staff in financial management; develop policies for finances, human resources, and procurement; hire consultants to develop business and marketing plans, purchase office equipment, and improve the quantity and quality of rice produced by farmer members through training, attending agricultural shows, and the purchase of modern hydro-tiller tractors.</narrative>
  </description>
